                                                "sense_id": "af3f20de-3614-39d1-849c-ee69179ab99f",
                                                "text": "[…] they [the sounds of an echo] next strike the ultimate secondary object, then the penultimate and antepenultimate; […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ffbccc8b-3db6-35d7-97e3-cc3beb5a3bd6",
